    "title": "Spider Solitaire Card Game",
    "description": "Spider Solitaire Card Game is one the most popular solitaire game.\r\nYou should not miss this Spider Solitaire if you are true lovers of card game. If you like classic card games or solitaire games like Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire etc., then Spider Solitaire is the one you don not want to miss.\r\nSpider Solitaire is easy to play. Start with 1 Suit and then challenge 2 Suits, 4 Suits  as your skills improved. This is the most interesting, artistic, and user-friendly Spider Solitaire you've ever played.\r\nTrain your brain by completing fun Daily Challenges & Goals to earn trophies. The more puzzles you solve, the more trophies you earn.\r\n\r\nYou're going to love playing this \"Spider Solitaire Card Game\":\r\n1. Very Big and Easy-to-see cards.\r\n2. Daily Challenge with new puzzle to activate your brain every day.\r\n3. Spider Solitaire Card Game provides 1, 2, 3 & 4 suit varieties\r\n4. Unlimited undo options and automatic hints.\r\n5. Play offline at any time.\r\n\r\nTotally free, please download this Spider Solitaire Card Game. \r\nIt is great honor for us if you enjoy \"Spider Solitaire Card Game\" and share it with your family and friends.",
